{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8a169023b5a241bd","type":"tool_result","content":"# MOVA: Towards Scalable and Synchronized Video-Audio Generation\narXiv: 2602.08794\nAuthors: \nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: \nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We develop MOVA, a synchronized video-audio generation model with an asymmetric dual-tower architecture that leverages pre-trained video and audio generation models.\n  2. We design a fine-grained audio-video captioning pipeline to produce high-quality bimodal training data at scale.\n  3. By scaling video-audio training, we achieve continuous improvements in synchronization performance across both modalities.\n\nTags: related-work, we develop, we design, by scaling\n---\n---","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2145e040-dde2-4bb7-ba36-d7ae557878f2","uuid":"3c340a22-d5b0-4686-8dcc-d7fd5616345e","timestamp":"2026-08-13T11:40:28.508Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# MOVA: Towards Scalable and Synchronized Video-Audio Generation\narXiv: 2602.08794\nAuthors: \nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: \nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We develop MOVA, a synchronized video-audio generation model with an asymmetric dual-tower architecture that leverages pre-trained video and audio generation models.\n  2. We design a fine-grained audio-video captioning pipeline to produce high-quality bimodal training data at scale.\n  3. By scaling video-audio training, we achieve continuous improvements in synchronization performance across both modalities.\n\nTags: related-work, we develop, we design, by scaling\n---\n---","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
