{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b49f668f0244e55a","type":"tool_result","content":"# NAVA: Native Audio-Visual Alignment for Generation\narXiv: 2605.30073\nAuthors: Longbin Ji∗\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: \nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We propose NAVA, a Native Audio-Visual Alignment framework that formulates joint audio-video generation as context-conditioned native audio-visual alignment to enable precise event-level correspondence modeling.\n  2. We introduce an Align-then-Fuse MMDiT architecture for modality-aware audio-video alignment and efficient collaborative denoising, alongside Timbre-in-Context Conditioning for flexible content-timbre binding.\n  3. Extensive experiments and user studies demonstrate that NAVA significantly outperforms representative baselines in audio-visual synchronization, semantic consistency, visual quality, and timbre controllability.\n\nTags: experiments, we propose, we introduce, extensive experiments","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2145e040-dde2-4bb7-ba36-d7ae557878f2","uuid":"1208b8bf-ab42-4095-adf9-edff2b679aca","timestamp":"2026-08-13T11:42:52.826Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# NAVA: Native Audio-Visual Alignment for Generation\narXiv: 2605.30073\nAuthors: Longbin Ji∗\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: \nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. We propose NAVA, a Native Audio-Visual Alignment framework that formulates joint audio-video generation as context-conditioned native audio-visual alignment to enable precise event-level correspondence modeling.\n  2. We introduce an Align-then-Fuse MMDiT architecture for modality-aware audio-video alignment and efficient collaborative denoising, alongside Timbre-in-Context Conditioning for flexible content-timbre binding.\n  3. Extensive experiments and user studies demonstrate that NAVA significantly outperforms representative baselines in audio-visual synchronization, semantic consistency, visual quality, and timbre controllability.\n\nTags: experiments, we propose, we introduce, extensive experiments","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
